 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Planning Apps for Sales (1O0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">For sales and distribution scenarios, this scope item provides key information that a sales manager needs regarding the creation and maintenance of Sales planning apps, effectively handling the different stages in sales planning. The Sales Manager can also select some existing sales plans to compare with actual data. In addition to this, they can navigate to the corresponding app for further analysis.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update a sales plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Copy sales plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release and search for a sales plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Compare plan and actual data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Navigate to the corresponding apps for further analysis</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Flexibility for the sales manager to handle the sales planning effectively</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create, manage, update and copy a sales plan to enable easier access to a sales manager</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Access various sales plans at the click of a link</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ability to export master data for the sales managers to use customer or customer group as a dimension</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Compare the planning data and actual data in the sales plans</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>面向销售的计划应用 (1O0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">对于销售和分销场景，此范围项目提供销售经理所需的关键信息，涉及创建和维护销售计划应用，有效地处理销售计划中的不同阶段。销售经理还可以选择要与实际数据进行比较的一些现有销售计划。除此之外，还可以导航到相应的应用以进行进一步分析。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更新销售计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制销售计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发布并搜索销售计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">比较计划和实际数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">导航到相应应用以进行进一步分析</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3cffa38bb223424780180a0b04b2b739__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">销售经理可以灵活高效地处理销售计划。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建、管理、更新和复制销售计划，以便更轻松地联系销售经理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">点击链接，访问各种销售计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">能够为销售经理导出主数据，以将客户或客户组用作维度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">比较销售计划中的计划数据和实际数据。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
